{"id": "guodian-jia.001", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "1", "text": "○（绝）智（知）弃卞（辩），民利百○（倍）。○（绝）○（巧）弃利，○（盗）恻（贼）亡又（有）。○（绝）○（伪）弃○，民复（復）季（孝）子（慈）。三言以", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简1"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.002", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "2", "text": "为○（辨）不足，或命（令）之或○（乎）豆（属）。视索（素）保仆（朴），少厶（私）须〈寡〉欲。江○（海）所以为百浴（谷）王，以其", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简2"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.003", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "3", "text": "能为百浴（谷）下，是以能为百浴（谷）王。圣人之才（在）民前也，以身后之；其才（在）民上也，以", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简3"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.004", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "4", "text": "言下之。其才（在）民上也，民弗厚也；其才（在）民前也，民弗害也。天下乐进而弗○（厌）。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简4"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.005", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "5", "text": "以其不静（争）也，古（故）天下莫能与之静（争）。○（罪）莫厚○（乎）甚欲，咎莫佥（憯）○（乎）谷（欲）得，", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简5"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.006", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "6", "text": "化（祸）莫大○（乎）不智（知）足。智（知）足之为足，此亘（恒）足矣。以○（道）差（佐）人○（主）者，不谷（欲）以兵强", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简6"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.007", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "7", "text": "于天下。善者果而已，不以取强。果而弗发（伐），果而弗乔（骄），果而弗○（矜），是胃（谓）果而不强。其", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简7"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.008", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "8", "text": "事好。长古之善为士者，必非（微）溺玄达，深不可志（识），是以为之颂（容）：夜（豫）○（乎）奴（若）冬涉川，猷（犹）○（乎）其", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简8"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.009", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "9", "text": "奴（若）○（畏）四○（邻），敢（严）○（乎）其奴（若）客，○（涣）○（乎）其奴（若）怿（释），屯○（乎）其奴（若）朴，○○（乎）其奴（若）浊。竺（孰）能浊以束（静）", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简9"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.010", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "10", "text": "者，○（将）舍（徐）清。竺（孰）能○以○者，○（将）舍（徐）生。保此○（道）者不谷（欲）○（尚）○（盈）。为之者败之，执之者远", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简10"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.011", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "11", "text": "之。是以圣人亡为古（故）亡败；亡执古（故）亡○（失）。临事之纪，誓（慎）冬（终）女（如）○（始），此亡败事矣。圣人谷（欲）", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简11"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.012", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "12", "text": "不谷（欲），不贵难得之货，○（教）不○（教），复众之所○（过）。是古（故）圣人能○（辅）万勿（物）之自○（然），而弗", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简12"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.013", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "13", "text": "能为。○（道）亘（恒）亡为也，侯王能守之，而万勿（物）○（将）自○（化）。○（化）而○（欲）○（作），○（将）贞（镇）之以亡名之○（朴）。夫", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简13"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.014", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "14", "text": "亦○（将）智（知）足，智（知）以束（静），万勿（物）○（将）自定。为亡为，事亡事，未（味）亡未（味）。大少（小）之多惕（易）必多○（难）。是以圣人", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简14"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.015", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "15", "text": "猷（犹）○（难）之，古（故）终亡○（难）。天下皆智（知）○（美）之为○（美）也，亚（恶）已；皆智（知）善，此其不善已。又（有）亡之相生也，", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简15"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.016", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "16", "text": "○（难）惕（易）之相成也，长○（短）之相型（形）也，高下之相○（盈）也，音圣（声）之相和也，先后之相堕（随）也。是", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简16"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.017", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "17", "text": "以圣人居亡为之事，行不言之○（教）。万勿（物）○（作）而弗○（始）也，为而弗志（恃）也，成而弗居。天〈夫〉唯", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简17"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.018", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "18", "text": "弗居也，是以弗去也。道亘（恒）亡名，仆（朴）唯（虽）妻（微），天○（地）弗敢臣，侯王女（如）能", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简18"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.019", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "19", "text": "○（守）之，万勿（物）○（将）自○（宾）。天○（地）相合也，以逾甘○（露）。民莫之命（令）天〈而〉自均安。○（始）折（制）又（有）名。名", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简19"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.020", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "20", "text": "亦既又（有），夫亦○（将）智（知）止，智（知）止所以不○（殆）。卑（譬）道之才（在）天下也，猷（犹）少（小）浴（谷）之与江○（海）。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简20"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.021", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "21", "text": "又（有）○○（○）成，先天○（地）生，○○（穆），蜀（独）立不亥（改），可以为天下母。未智（知）其名，○（字）之曰道，○（吾）", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简21"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.022", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "22", "text": "强为之名曰大。大曰○，○曰○〈远〉，○〈远〉曰反（返）。天大，○（地）大，道大，王亦大。国中又（有）四大安，王○（居）一安。人", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简22"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.023", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "23", "text": "法○（地），○（地）法天，天法道，道法自○（然）。天○（地）之○（间），其猷（犹）○（橐）○〈籥〉与？虚而不屈，○（动）而愈出。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简23"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.024", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "24", "text": "至虚，亘（恒）也；兽（守）中，○（笃）也。万勿（物）方（旁）○（作），居以须复也。天道员员，各复其堇（根）。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简24"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.025", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "25", "text": "其安也，易○也。其未○（兆）也，易○（谋）也。其○（脆）也，易畔（判）也。其几也，易○（散）也。为之于其", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简25"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.026", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "26", "text": "亡又（有）也。○（治）之于其未乱。合□□□□□□□，九成之台甲□□□□□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简26"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 18, "end": 25}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 31, "end": 40}]}
{"id": "guodian-jia.027", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "27", "text": "足下。智（知）之者弗言，言之者弗智（知）。○（闭）其○（兑），赛（塞）其门，和其光，○（同）其○（尘），○其○，解其纷，", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简27"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.028", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "28", "text": "是胃（谓）玄同。古（故）不可得天〈而〉新（亲），亦不可得而疋（疏）；不可得而利，亦不可得而害：", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简28"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.029", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "29", "text": "不可得而贵，亦可不可得而○（贱）。古（故）为天下贵。以正之（治）邦，以○（奇）○（用）兵，以亡事", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简29"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.030", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "30", "text": "取天下。○（吾）可（何）以智（知）其○（然）也。夫天多期（忌）韦（讳），而民尔（弥）畔（叛）。民多利器，而邦慈（滋）昏。人多", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简30"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.031", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "31", "text": "智（知）天〈而〉○（奇）勿（物）慈（滋）○（起）。法勿（物）慈（滋）章（彰），○（盗）恻（贼）多又（有）。是以圣人之言曰：我无事而民自○（富）。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简31"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.032", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "32", "text": "我亡为而民自○（化）。我好青（静）而民自正。我谷（欲）不谷（欲）而民自朴。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简32"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.033", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "33", "text": "○（含）○（德）之厚者，比于赤子，○（○）○虫它（蛇）弗○（○），攫鸟○（猛）兽弗扣，骨溺（弱）○（筋）○（柔）而捉", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简33"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.034", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "34", "text": "固。未智（知）牝戊（牡）之合然○（怒），精之至也。终日○（乎）而不○（忧），和之至也，和曰○〈○（常）〉，智（知）和曰明。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简34"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.035", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "35", "text": "○（益）生曰○（祥），心○（使）○（气）曰○（强），勿（物）○（壮）则老，是胃（谓）不道。 名与身○（孰）新（亲）？身与货", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简35"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.036", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "36", "text": "○（孰）多？○（得）与○（亡）○（孰）○（病）？甚○（爱）必大○（费），○（厚）○（藏）必多○（亡）。古（故）智（知）足不辱，智（知）止不怠（殆），可", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简36"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.037", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "37", "text": "以长旧（久）。\n返也者，道○（动）也。溺（弱）也者，道之○（用）也。天下之勿（物）生于又（有），生于亡。 ○而○（盈）", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简37"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.038", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "38", "text": "之，不不若已。湍而群之，不可长保也。金玉○（盈）室，莫能兽（守）也。贵福（富）乔（骄），自遗咎", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简38"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-jia.039", "witness": "guodian-jia", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "39", "text": "也。攻（功）述（遂）身退，天之道也。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/甲/简39"}, "status": "unverified"}
